{"words": [{"text": "فَلَمَّا", "translation": "When"}, {"text": "رَءَا", "translation": "he saw"}, {"text": "ٱلشَّمْسَ", "translation": "the sun"}, {"text": "بَازِغَةًۭ", "translation": "rising"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "he said"}, {"text": "هَـٰذَا", "translation": "This (is)"}, {"text": "رَبِّى", "translation": "my Lord"}, {"text": "هَـٰذَآ", "translation": "this (is)"}, {"text": "أَكْبَرُ ۖ", "translation": "greater"}, {"text": "فَلَمَّآ", "translation": "But when"}, {"text": "أَفَلَتْ", "translation": "it set"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "he said"}, {"text": "يَـٰقَوْمِ", "translation": "O my people"}, {"text": "إِنِّى", "translation": "Indeed, I am"}, {"text": "بَرِىٓءٌۭ", "translation": "free"}, {"text": "مِّمَّا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "تُشْرِكُونَ", "translation": "you associate (with Allah)"}], "sahih": "And when he saw the sun rising, he said, \"This is my lord; this is greater.\" But when it set, he said, \"O my people, indeed I am free from what you associate with Allāh."}